Priority: optional
Maintainer: Qualcomm Technologies, Inc. <oss@qualcomm.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake (>= 3.21), git
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: qcnpuperf
Architecture: arm64
Depends: qcom-fastrpc1, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Qualcomm NPU/DSP performance metrics library and daemon
 libqcnpuperf exposes Qualcomm NPU and DSP hardware performance counters
 (Q6 utilization, Q6 clock, HVX utilization, HMX utilization) via the
 FastRPC transport on Qualcomm SoCs.
 .
 This package contains the shared runtime library, development headers,
 pkg-config file, and qcnpuperfd: a daemon that polls the DSP every 500 ms
 and atomically writes a fresh metrics snapshot to /dev/shm/qcnpuperf.
 No historical data is retained; the file always reflects the current state.
